# Copy this to .env (local dev) or set as a GitHub Actions secret named GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.
# Get a client ID from Google Cloud Console: APIs & Services > Credentials > Create Credentials > OAuth client ID (Web application).
# Add your origins (e.g. http://localhost:5173 and https://<user>.github.io) to "Authorized JavaScript origins".
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
